    "storage": "Pickles keep 2 weeks in the fridge and improve for the first three days. Grilled pork keeps 3 days. ⛔ Make the dipping bowl fresh each time — it is mostly water and it does not keep, and the whole argument of the dish is that it changes during one meal, not over four days.",
    "chefNotes": "Season the bowl like a soup, not like a dip. Cut the pickles thick or they go limp in the warm liquid. Work the mince until it is tacky. Char harder than feels polite. And keep the noodles cold and separate — the moment they go into the bowl to stay, it stops being bún chả.",
    "pairsWith": "Gỏi Cuốn to start · Cold beer · Chè Chuối after",
